WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.100 --> 00:00:05.004
(audience applauds)
(upbeat music)

00:00:05.905 --> 00:00:10.744
♪ Do you believe in magic
in a young girl's heart ♪

00:00:10.744 --> 00:00:14.013
♪ How the music can free
her whenever it starts ♪

00:00:14.013 --> 00:00:17.684
♪ And it's magic if
the music is groovy ♪

00:00:17.684 --> 00:00:21.187
♪ It makes you feel happy
like an old-time movie ♪

00:00:21.187 --> 00:00:24.357
♪ I'll tell you about the magic,
and it'll free your soul ♪

00:00:24.357 --> 00:00:26.192
♪ But it's like trying
to tell a stranger ♪

00:00:26.192 --> 00:00:28.627
♪ 'Bout rock and roll ♪

00:00:28.627 --> 00:00:32.965
♪ If you believe in magic,
don't bother to choose ♪

00:00:32.965 --> 00:00:36.436
♪ If it's jug band music
or rhythm and blues ♪

00:00:36.436 --> 00:00:40.139
♪ Just go and listen,
it'll start with a smile ♪

00:00:40.139 --> 00:00:43.743
♪ It won't wipe off your face
no matter how hard you try ♪

00:00:43.743 --> 00:00:47.013
♪ Your feet start tapping
and you can't seem to find ♪

00:00:47.013 --> 00:00:51.985
♪ How you got there, so
just blow your mind ♪

00:00:52.786 --> 00:00:53.620
(guitar solo)

00:01:03.362 --> 00:01:07.800
♪ If you believe in magic,
come along with me ♪

00:01:07.800 --> 00:01:11.003
♪ We'll dance until morning
'til there's just you and me ♪

00:01:11.003 --> 00:01:14.908
♪ And maybe, if the
music is right ♪

00:01:14.908 --> 00:01:18.278
♪ I'll meet you tomorrow,
sort of late at night ♪

00:01:18.278 --> 00:01:21.781
♪ And we'll go dancing,
baby, then you'll see ♪

00:01:21.781 --> 00:01:25.584
♪ How the magic's in the
music and the music's in me ♪

00:01:25.584 --> 00:01:30.589
♪ Yeah, do you
believe in magic ♪

00:01:31.457 --> 00:01:35.561
♪ Yeah, believe in the magic
of a young girl's soul ♪

00:01:35.561 --> 00:01:39.032
♪ Believe in the magic
of rock and roll ♪

00:01:39.032 --> 00:01:43.236
♪ Believe in the magic
that can set you free ♪

00:01:43.236 --> 00:01:47.573
♪ Ohh, talking 'bout the magic ♪

00:01:47.573 --> 00:01:51.778
♪ Like I believe in magic 
(Do you believe in magic) ♪

00:01:51.778 --> 00:01:55.048
♪ Do you believe
like I believe ♪

00:01:55.048 --> 00:01:56.816
♪ Do you believe
like I believe ♪

00:01:56.816 --> 00:01:59.252
(audience cheers)

